  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/JFF7vxPq/Lios-Outlandish-Village-1.png\" alt=\"Lios-Outlandish-Village-1\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">探索一座靈感來自哈比人的迷人村莊，它隱藏在鬱鬱蔥蔥的山丘之中，充滿溫馨的家園與活潑的村民。漫步於燈光優美的洞穴內部，在頂層池塘邊放鬆身心，並留意尋找一個隱藏按鈕——找到它即可開啟村民們秘密埋藏的寶藏庫！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vC3r8VSc/compatibility.png\" alt=\"compatibility\" width=\"449\" height=\"41\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>本模組不會覆蓋原有的原版村莊，因此能與其他村莊改造模組（例如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lios-overhauled-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lio's Overhauled Villages</a>）完全相容！作為全新系列的一部分，Lio's Outlandish Villages 旨在帶來風格獨特的城鎮與充滿冒險性的建築供玩家探索！</em></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/m5LGyB8T/morefromthisseries.png\" alt=\"morefromthisseries\" width=\"586\" height=\"36\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiral-tower-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qLJcs1SQ/spiral-towers.png\" alt=\"spiral-towers\" width=\"376\" height=\"62\"> </a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12)\"><a style=\"display:flex;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n<div style=\"text-align:left;line-height:1.35\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">需要基於資料包的配置功能？</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px\">試試 <strong>LioLoader</strong>，實現全局資料包／資源包載入。支援 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 與 <strong>Fabric</strong>，適用於 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong>。</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px\">前往 CurseForge 開啟 LioLoader →</div>\n</div>\n</a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"youtube-reviews\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\"></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p>-於 11:59 評測-<br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rM1fSI28POk?start=719\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sPHes7q4Pr\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\"></a></h2><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/hJvQHRN5/usageinmodpacks.png\" alt=\"usageinmodpacks\" width=\"573\" height=\"39\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">歡迎將 <strong>哈比山丘村莊</strong> 加入任何您選擇的 Minecraft 模組包中。我們鼓勵您將這些建築融入自訂組合包，打造獨特而引人入勝的冒險體驗。無需特別申請許可——盡情探索並以您喜愛的方式享受這些村莊吧！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
